%% Protocol v2 document sync (ADR-006): the Mac owns the document, the tablet mirrors it.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Pen
  participant T as Tablet (CanvasDocument + renderer)
  participant H as Mac (StrokeStore + DocumentSync)

  Note over T,H: connect / reconnect
  T->>H: canvas.viewport {x, y, zoom}
  H->>T: doc.reset
  H->>T: stroke.begin(style) / stroke.point / stroke.end × every stroke
  Note over T: keeps strokes it had not finished sending (outage drawing)

  Note over T,H: drawing
  P->>T: MotionEvent
  T->>T: draw segment locally (render thread, dirty rect only)
  T->>H: stroke.begin / stroke.point / stroke.end (canvas px)
  H->>T: stroke.style {tool, colour, width}
  Note over H: markKnown(id): the tablet already has it

  Note over T,H: editing (either side)
  T->>H: canvas.command {undo | redo | clear}
  H->>H: StrokeStore applies; DocumentSync.diff(ids)
  H->>T: doc.remove {ids}  and/or  stroke.* for strokes the tablet lacks

  Note over T,H: navigation
  T->>H: canvas.viewport (gesture end; ≤ 10/s while dragging)
  H->>T: canvas.viewport (Mac Fit all / Home)
